 Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s4","report_id":"dev_005","text":"Figure 1 shows the accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s5","report_id":"dev_005","text":"As shown in Figure 1, BERT-base scores 10.6 points higher on 10 than on 5.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s6","report_id":"dev_005","text":"BERT-base scores about 3 points higher on 35 than on 25.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s7","report_id":"dev_005","text":"At epoch 30, BERT-base achieves 75.9% accuracy.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s8","report_id":"dev_005","text":"At epoch 15, BERT-base achieves 70.3% accuracy.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s9","report_id":"dev_005","text":"Figure 2 shows the f1 score during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s10","report_id":"dev_005","text":"As shown in Figure 2, at epoch 13, Baseline is 9 points better than Transformer.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s11","report_id":"dev_005","text":"BERT-base attains a F1 score of over 80% at epoch 11 (Figure 2).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s12","report_id":"dev_005","text":"CNN attains a F1 score of about 70% at epoch 2.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s13","report_id":"dev_005","text":"Baseline reaches 90.0% F1 score at epoch 18.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s14","report_id":"dev_005","text":"Figure 3 shows the accuracy during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s15","report_id":"dev_005","text":"At epoch 30, BERT-base achieves 62.8% accuracy.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s16","report_id":"dev_005","text":"GRU reaches 54% accuracy at epoch 10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s17","report_id":"dev_005","text":"As shown in Figure 3, BERT-base reaches 88.0% accuracy at epoch 80.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s18","report_id":"dev_005","text":"On STL-10, XGBoost obtains an accuracy of 64.4%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_005_s19","report_id":"dev_005","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"}]}